      "blocks": {
        "item_YhyjJt": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I know if CURVJEANS will fit me?",
            "content": "<p>We get it—finding jeans that <em>actually <\/em>fit is a struggle. That’s why CURVJEANS are designed specifically for smaller waists and wider hips.<br\/><br\/>Check our <a href=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.com\/pages\/size-guide\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Size Guide\">size guide <\/a>with real measurements and do our fit quiz or simply DM us! Still unsure? Our returns are super easy.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "item_THfNfg": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if I order the wrong size?",
            "content": "<p>No worries! You have 14 days to exchange or return—completely hassle-free. Just try them on at home and if it’s not love at first fit, you'll easy start your return via our <a href=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.returnless.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.returnless.com\/\">return page<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "item_7egfLh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if they're not the one?",
            "content": "<p>No stress! Not head over heels? Send them back within 14 days - it's that easy! Our returns means zero drama 💕<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "item_kJGmng": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes CURVJEANS different from regular jeans?",
            "content": "<p>We’re made different. CURVJEANS are designed for women with curves—especially if you’ve got stronger legs, glutes, and a small waist. No awkward fits, no compromises—just jeans that move with you instead of against you.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "item_M7ecB8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are CURVJEANS stretchy?",
            "content": "<p>YES! Our stretch is like magic! They hold their shape (no baggy knees!) but move with you all day. Dance, sit, run - these babies won't let you down.<br\/><br\/>Plus, they're actually comfy enough to wear all day!<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "item_btxATh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will they stay up without a belt?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! CURVJEANS are made with a special waistband that fits snug at the waist—no more sliding down or constant adjusting. You can finally ditch the belt.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Ckt4Wt": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will I receive my order?",
            "content": "<p>Can't wait to get your perfect jeans? We get it! Your CURVJEANS will arrive in 5-6 working days. We'll keep you updated every step of the way! 📦✨<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "item_XkAAKm": {
          "type": "item",
